      "content": [
        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": [],
          "text": "I\u2019ve built the comparison around your \u00a3120,000 monthly recurring revenue baseline and \u00a3150,000 target.\n\n- A provisional first pass exists, using your figures; it is not validated.\n- Keeping pricing holds today\u2019s values; the other two options reach the goal structurally.\n- The starter tier cannot yet be tested against the target because support burden has no stated revenue impact.\n\nIs your goal total monthly recurring revenue across all tiers, including the starter tier?"
        }
      ],
      "phase": "final_answer",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
